From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vector Runtime Team <runtime@getvector.app>
Date: Thu, 02 Apr 2026 16:00:00 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] programs/vectorvmctl: add NT memory bridge utility for Vector

This patch adds a runtime utility (`vectorvmctl`) that exposes JSON-first
process-memory operations for tooling clients:

- process list
- module list / base range
- memory map / query semantics
- memory read
- memory write

Implementation goal:
- call Nt* primitives directly for memory operations
- avoid host-side VM access paths
- keep per-process Wine isolation boundaries

Client contract is matched by VectorKit's `WineProcessMemoryService`
NT bridge transport.

---
 configure.ac                         |   1 +
 programs/vectorvmctl/Makefile.in     |  10 +
 programs/vectorvmctl/main.c          | 433 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 444 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 programs/vectorvmctl/Makefile.in
 create mode 100644 programs/vectorvmctl/main.c

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
